"startedSeq":6570,"endedSeq":6577,"timestamp":"1788610540Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"PowerShell","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0d7c9e14230e6306016a9c07fd702c87d08918c4cd1a7fee35","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"f56b5974-82d9-4eae-a75a-280ec5aaf92b","seq":7446,"startedSeq":6581,"endedSeq":7446,"timestamp":"1788610562Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"已完成全部 Stage 4 BLOCKER 收尾工作，未输出 artifact。\n\n### 实现与验证\n\n- 修复 Host 关闭时 HCP queue-resume 可能无限等待的问题。\n- Permission 风险信息现在由策略显式提供，并持久化为 canonical snapshot：\n  - workspace identity\n  - risk level\n  - stable `ruleId`\n  - creation/expiry time\n- Host 重启恢复不再重新执行当前策略来改写既有 Permission 风险。\n- REST/HCP、Zustand 和 Permission Dialog 均投影同一 canonical Permission 事实。\n- 不完整 Permission 事件 fail-closed，不打开授权 Dialog。\n- 英文和简体中文 Dialog 均展示：\n  - 实际 Tool\n  - 参数摘要\n  - 目标 workspace\n  - 风险等级\n  - 策略规则 ID\n  - 授权原因\n\n### 浏览器验证\n\n真实 Local Host harness 已在以下视口通过：\n\n- 1440×900\n- 820×900\n- Pixel 7\n\n覆盖：\n\n- axe serious/critical\n- Dialog focus containment\n- forced-colors\n- Tool/argument/workspace/risk 可见性\n- Tool 完成\n- canonical reload restoration\n- post-auth failure artifact launch-token 扫描\n\n截图视觉复核通过，无裁切、溢出或敏感信息。\n\n### Remote Host 实机验证\n\n使用固定 **Eclipse Temurin 21.0.12.1+1** 构建 Linux x64 bundle：\n\n- 160 个 regular files\n- archive SHA-256：\n  `f7d49668796cceb1b3589b4c77f8b0ce43bf913571400dca603a3e7f6e5d1f59`\n- Ed25519 签名逐文件 inventory：\n  - safe relative path\n  - POSIX mode\n  - SHA-256\n\n授权 Ubuntu 非 root 环境验证通过：\n\n- 签名及精确 inventory\n- pairing\n- 动态、互异 loopback 端口：\n  - REST `42273`\n  - HCP `34611`\n- locator 与 operation 持久化\n- 两条 SSH tunnel\n- completed-operation retry\n- side-by-side upgrade\n- failed-health rollback\n- 最终 `ji-host.service` 为 active/running\n\n实机测试还发现并修复了 SSH 双层 shell 对 inventory 的转义问题：\n\n- 保留 `\\t`/`\\n` 到最终 `printf`\n- 使用 `${hash%% *}` 提取 `sha256sum` hash，避免嵌套引号失真\n\n没有操作 Caddy、Docker、其他业务服务或非 JI 目录。\n\n### 最终门禁\n\n最终源码上的 `scripts/verify-stage4.ps1` 完整通过，exit code 0，包括：\n\n- Stage 0–3 回归\n- generated contracts\n- API baseline\n- module boundaries\n- naming\n- Java tests\n- Web unit tests：22/22\n- Browser tests：9/9\n- Host restart\n- standalone clean unpack\n\n额外检查通过：\n\n- frozen lockfile\n- `git diff --check`\n- secret scan\n- evidence secret scan\n- submodule boundary\n- browser/Host/SSH tunnel/test-process cleanup\n\n`original-pi` 和 `gold-band` 均未修改。\n\n### 本地提交\n\n已创建且仅创建一个新提交：\n\n```text\n70d37ca3f17e7fd83487fb4e55e5f4e6cacde41e\nfix(java-rewrite): close stage 4 acceptance blockers\n```\n\n包含要求的 footer：\n\n```text\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n```\n\n未 push，未创建 PR，未进入 Stage 5。工作树仅剩 runtime 管理的未跟踪 `.gold-band/`。下一步应由独立 `codex-acp` / `pf-builtin-accept` 节点执行 Stage 4 再验收；独立 PASS 前不进入 Stage 5。"},{"id":"acp-event-7449","kind":"sessionInfo","title":"你先不输出artifact，继续完成你未完成的工作吧 <hidden data-gold-band-hidden=\"true\" show=\"false\" title=\"Gold Band runtime control\"> 请先完整执行本消息中的用户指令，然后继续完成你之前的任务。本 turn 不适用此前的 artifact 输出约束，也不要输出 artifact；完成后再由 Runtime…","sessionId":"f56b5974-82d9-4eae-a75a-280ec5aaf92b","seq":7449,"startedSeq":7449,"endedSeq":7449,"timestamp":"1788610580Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"turn-file-change-set:turn-files-0b047106806c8da47d14e2fa992522bf","kind":"fileChangeSet","status":"partial","sessionId":"f56b5974-82d9-4eae-a75a-280ec5aaf92b","seq":7450,"startedSeq":7450,"endedSeq":7450,"timestamp":"1788610580Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"acp-event-7451","kind":"modeUpdate","sessionId":"f56b5974-82d9-4eae-a75a-280ec5aaf92b","seq":7451,"startedSeq":7451,"endedSeq":7451,"timestamp":"1788610580Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id"